xt":"Fallback Cryo and Burst damage.","stats":"ATK% · Cryo DMG · CRIT"},{"names":["Blizzard Strayer","Gladiator's Finale"],"text":"Fallback Cryo and ATK bonuses.","stats":"ATK% · Cryo DMG · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Permafrost Waltz","members":["Kamisato Ayaka","Shenhe","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Shenhe buffs Cryo hits, Kokomi keeps enemies Frozen and heals, while Kazuha groups foes and shreds Cryo RES.","roles":["Main DPS","Cryo Buffer","Hydro Healer","Anemo Support"]},{"name":"Fanfare Frost","members":["Kamisato Ayaka","Furina","Charlotte","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Furina supplies Hydro and a large damage buff; Charlotte heals for Fanfare and helps battery Ayaka. Kazuha groups and shreds RES.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Cryo Enabler","Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Winter Court","members":["Kamisato Ayaka","Mona","Diona","Sucrose"],"text":"Mona adds Hydro and Omen damage amplification, Diona shields, heals, and generates Cryo particles, while Sucrose groups and shreds RES.","roles":["On-field DPS","Buffer / Hydro Enabler","Shielder / Healer","EM Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Snowbound Symphony","members":["Kamisato Ayaka","Shenhe","Escoffier","Furina"],"text":"Shenhe boosts Cryo damage, Escoffier heals and reduces Cryo/Hydro RES, and Furina provides off-field Hydro and damage buffs.","roles":["On-field DPS","Cryo Buffer","Healer / Debuffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer"]}],"v":"Boss / Unfreezable: Keep Blizzard Strayer for Cryo aura; build more CRIT Rate if Freeze uptime is low.\nF2P / Energy: Amenoma Kageuchi eases Burst uptime; Finale of the Deep deals more with good healing.\nFurina Freeze: Pair Furina with strong team healing; optimize ER and CRIT before chasing ATK.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Ayaka is an on-field Cryo DPS whose powerful 80-Energy Burst delivers most of her damage. Freeze teams help keep enemies inside its path, while her Cryo-infused attacks add damage between Bursts. She needs strong Energy support and careful positioning.","pros":["Powerful Burst damage","Strong Freeze control","Cryo-infused attacks","Excellent AoE potential"],"cons":["High Burst cost","Needs careful positioning","Struggles vs mobile foes","Freeze fails on some bosses"],"weapons":["Mistsplitter Reforged","Absolution","Haran Geppaku Futsu","Light of Foliar Incision","Primordial Jade Cutter","Finale of the Deep","Wolf-Fang","Amenoma Kageuchi"],"arts":[{"sets":["Blizzard Strayer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Blizzard Strayer","Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Blizzard Strayer","Gladiator's Finale"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":""}],"main":["ATK%","Cryo DMG","Crit DMG / ATK%"],"stats":["CR: 30% - 45%","CD: 200% - 250%","ATK: 1.8k - 2.3k","ER: 130% - 150%"],"vars":[{"title":"Boss / Unfreezable","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Mistsplitter Reforged","Absolution","Finale of the Deep"],"arts":[{"sets":["Blizzard Strayer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Blizzard Strayer","Gladiator's Finale"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs"}],"stats":"Aim for more sheet CRIT Rate than in full Freeze; Blizzard Strayer grants only 20% against Cryo-affected, unfrozen enemies.","teams":"Reliable Cryo application, a battery and damage buffers; Hydro is not required.","when":"Against bosses and enemies that cannot be Frozen. Position carefully so her Burst connects fully.","cond":"Lower Blizzard Strayer CRIT bonus without Freeze.","notes":"Two-piece mixed sets can be easier to balance with CRIT Rate swords.","pre":false},{"title":"Craftable / F2P","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Finale of the Deep","Amenoma Kageuchi","Kagotsurube Isshin"],"arts":[{"sets":["Blizzard Strayer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Use enough ER to Burst every rotation. Amenoma reduces ER needs, particularly with refinements.","teams":"Finale of the Deep prefers a strong healer to clear Bond of Life.","when":"When avoiding limited 5-star weapons. Finale improves damage; Amenoma is easier for Energy-hungry rotations.","cond":"Finale passive needs Bond of Life cleared; Amenoma appreciates high refinements.","notes":"Finale is crafted in Fontaine; Amenoma is crafted in Inazuma.","pre":false},{"title":"Furina Freeze","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Mistsplitter Reforged","Finale of the Deep","Amenoma Kageuchi"],"arts":[{"sets":["Blizzard Strayer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Balance ER, CRIT DMG and ATK; an ATK% Goblet can be competitive with strong damage bonuses.","teams":"Furina and a reliable healer, plus Cryo Energy support.","when":"When leveraging Furina’s team damage buffs and Hydro application in an Ayaka Freeze team.","cond":"Healing must sustain Fanfare and rotations.","notes":"A Cryo damage Goblet remains the general default.","pre":false}],"mats":["Shivada Jade Sliver","Shivada Jade Fragment","Shivada Jade Chunk","Shivada Jade Gemstone","Perpetual Heart","Teachings of Elegance","Guide to Elegance","Philosophies of Elegance","Old Handguard","Kageuchi Handguard","Famed Handguard","Sakura Bloom","Bloodjade Branch","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 8-9+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 6-8"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Permafrost Waltz","members":["Kamisato Ayaka","Shenhe","Sangonomiya Kokomi","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Fanfare Frost","members":["Kamisato Ayaka","Furina","Charlotte","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Winter Court","members":["Kamisato Ayaka","Mona","Diona","Sucrose"]},{"name":"Snowbound Symphony","members":["Kamisato Ayaka","Shenhe","Escoffier","Furina"]}]}}],"title":"Kamisato Ayaka","el":"Cryo"}